{"id":18965,"date":"2025-12-08T22:42:37","date_gmt":"2025-12-08T22:42:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?page_id=18965"},"modified":"2025-12-08T22:42:37","modified_gmt":"2025-12-08T22:42:37","slug":"dj-danny-t","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/dj-danny-t\/","title":{"rendered":"DJ Danny T"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-18966\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/image1.jpeg\" alt=\"A person wearing a green plaid jacket over a black shirt, looking slightly upward while holding the jacket lapels with both hands.\" width=\"210\" height=\"320\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/image1.jpeg 210w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/image1-197x300.jpeg 197w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 210px) 100vw, 210px\" \/>Born in Atlanta and raised in Gary, Indiana, <strong>Danny T<\/strong>\u00a0has been bringing unforgettable energy to events since he first stepped behind the decks in 2012. With a background in hosting private events, fashion shows, birthday parties, and more, Danny blends professionalism with an approachable, high-vibe style that clients love.<\/p>\n<h3><strong>What Drew Danny to DJing<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>Danny was captivated early on by the electric energy that comes from mixing and blending music. The art of scratching records, the creativity of transitions, and the ability to move a crowd all play a big part in what fuels his passion behind the turntables.<\/p>\n<h3><strong>What\u2019s in His Headphones<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>Danny\u2019s musical palette spans almost every genre\u2014Hip Hop, House, Reggaeton, Country, Rock, and Afrobeats. This diverse range makes him a versatile DJ who can read any crowd and adapt instantly to the moment.<\/p>\n<h3><strong>Best Part About DJing<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>For Danny, nothing compares to bringing people together to enjoy a shared moment on the dance floor. Creating joy, connection, and memories is what drives his craft every single event.<\/p>\n<h3><strong>Favorite Events to DJ<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>Danny thrives at\u00a0<strong>theme parties<\/strong>\u2014whether it\u2019s the 70s, 80s, 90s, or special themed celebrations of all kinds. His creativity and energy shine brightest when he\u2019s helping bring a theme to life.<\/p>\n<h3><strong>Go-To Dance Floor Fillers<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>Expect to hear high-energy party favorites, Pitbull anthems, the Cupid Shuffle, and other guaranteed crowd-pleasers when Danny is in control of the vibe.<\/p>\n<h3><strong>Beyond the Booth<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>Danny is a proud husband and father of four boys. When he\u2019s not DJing, he\u2019s cheering on the\u00a0<strong>Georgia Bulldogs<\/strong>, coaching his kids\u2019 flag football teams, or binge-watching movies and TV shows with his family.<br \/>\nA true multi-talent, Danny is also a gifted musician\u2014he plays the keyboard, drums, and bass guitar, and he both sings and raps. Music isn\u2019t just a job for him; it\u2019s part of who he is.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Born in Atlanta and raised in Gary, Indiana, Danny T\u00a0has been bringing unforgettable energy to events since he first stepped behind the decks in 2012. With a background in hosting private events, fashion shows, birthday parties, and more, Danny blends professionalism with an approachable, high-vibe style that clients love. What Drew Danny to DJing Danny&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-18965","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>DJ Danny T - JAMMIN&#039; DJ